{"articleNo":"1915","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1915&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"금오공과대학교 산학협력중심교수 초빙","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.07.21","hit":"9043","attachments":[{"name":"양식[별첨].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1915&attachNo=71491"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">금오공과대학교 산학협력중점교수 초빙</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#000080\" height=\"13\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"627\">\n            <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 초빙분야 및 인원&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"30\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"280\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 2.5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움체’; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">초빙분야</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"30\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"114\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 11pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움체’; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">초빙인원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"30\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"239\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움체’; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">비고</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"280\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; TEXT-INDENT: 5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">산학협력중점교수</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"114\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"239\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;산학협력단</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; 2. 응모자격</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">교육공무원 임용에 결격사유가 없는 4년제 대학졸업 자&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; 나. 위 “가”목의 공통과 아래 각 호의 1에 해당하는 자<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">상장회사 15년이상 근무자로서 최종 직급이 임원이상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">인 자<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 공공기관 15년이상 근무자로서 산학협력업무 유경험자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 채용방법 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 2.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1차 : 기초심사(지원자격 충족여부<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;- 2차 : 면접(기초심사 결과 “적격“ 후보자을 대상으로 실시하며, 중점<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교수로서의&nbsp; 자질 및 사명감, 사업단 활성화 기여 가능성 등을 평가)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 제출서류&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 산학협력중점 교수초빙 지원서 1부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(붙임양식 다운로드 사용)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 지원서, 이력서, 자기소개서</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학력 및 성적증명서(학사, 석사, 박사) 원본 각 1부<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (외국대학에서 학위를 취득한 경우는 학위증 사본과 본인이 날인한 국문<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 번역본 제출)&nbsp;<br><br><strong>&nbsp; 다. 경력(재직)증명서&nbsp;&nbsp; 각 1부&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><br><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 외국어로 된 증명서는 본인이 날인한 번역문을 첨부<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 부득이 사본을 제출한 경우에는 원본과 대조할 수 있도록 원본을 지참<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 하여&nbsp;&nbsp;확인을 받고, 본인이 서명한 후 제출<br><br><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 지원서 접수<br>&nbsp;<br></span>&nbsp;가. 접수 방법<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 지원서, 표지, 자기소개서를 포함한 제출서류는 직접 또는 우편으로&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 제출하며, 접수마감일시까지 도착한 것에 한함<br><br>&nbsp;나. 접수 기간&nbsp;<br></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 방문서류접수 : 2011. 8. 4(목) ~ 8.8(월) 09:00 ~ 18:00 까지&nbsp;<br><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">다. 접수처 및 주소<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 접수처 : 금오공과대학교 산학협력단 산학협력팀(본관 3층 304호)<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 주 소 : &nbsp;730-701 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지&nbsp;<br><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 기 타</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본 공고에 명시되지 않은 사항은 교육공무원법 등 관계 법령 및 본교 인사관련 규정에 의함</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 지원서 및 구비서류의 허위, 착오, 누락, 미비 등으로 인해 심사에 불이익이 발생할 경우에는 본인이 책임을 지며, 허위 사실로 확인될 경우 임용을 취소할 수 있음</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 접수 후에도 서류제출 마감일까지 서류 미제출할 경우 접수를 취소함 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 적격자가 없을 경우 초빙하지 않을 수 있음</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 제출된 서류는 요청이 있을 경우, 2011년 11월 이후 반환 함. </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 기타 문의사항은 본교 산학협력단 산학협력팀으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 담당자 연락처 : 전화 (054)478-7247&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 팩스 (054)478-7251</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼엑스포’; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2011년 7월&nbsp;&nbsp; 일</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; FONT-SIZE: 26pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">금오공과대학교총장</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
